        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BDS30, Solid Brass Baseboard Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFrom high-end residences to large commercial projects, this simple door stop is sure to get the job done. The 3-1/4 Inch Baseboard Door Bumper screws onto the baseboard casement or door bottom to protect not just the wall, but your door knob or lever as well. Two tips are included with each door stop: a white one and a grey one. It is made out of solid brass and is available in array of great finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BDS30-specifications.gif?v=1704354540\" width\"490\" height=\"167\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Solid Brass 3-1/4 Inch Baseboard Door Bumper Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-1-3-8-inch-short-baseboard-door-stop-deltana-bds125\"><b>1-1/2\" baseboard door stop</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-baseboard-door-bumper-deltana-bds425\"><b>4\"  baseboard door stop</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-baseboard-door-bumper\"><b>Replacement Rubber Tips</b></a>..\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BDS30 Baseboard Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Tips: White and Gray Tip included</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BDS30-speficiations.pdf?v=1691095327\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BDS30 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 3-1/4 Inch Baseboard Door Bumper",
                "description": "Solid Brass Baseboard Door Bumper, Deltana BDS30 - From high-end residences to large commercial projects, this simple door stop is sure to get the job done. The 3-1/4 Inch Baseboard Door Bumper screws onto the baseboard casement or door bottom to protect not just the wall, but your door knob or lever as well. Two tips are included with each door stop: a white one and a grey one. It is made out of solid brass and is available 12 great finishes. ",
